Subject: [PATCH] Preserve explicit neutral VSTest UI culture on current ICU

Against microsoft/vstest c1b6b2c1ab4c8f181f3cb1a436afb6428009c7ab.
CreateSpecificCulture changes explicit zh-Hans/zh-Hant to regional cultures
whose current ICU parent chain omits the original script-neutral resources.
GetCultureInfo preserves the caller's declared resource culture. This does
not claim arbitrary regional Chinese fallback compatibility.

diff --git a/src/vstest.console/Program.cs b/src/vstest.console/Program.cs
--- a/src/vstest.console/Program.cs
+++ b/src/vstest.console/Program.cs
@@ -51,7 +51,7 @@ namespace Microsoft.VisualStudio.TestPlatform.CommandLine
             {
                 try
                 {
-                    CultureInfo.DefaultThreadCurrentUICulture = CultureInfo.CreateSpecificCulture(userCultureSpecified);
+                    CultureInfo.DefaultThreadCurrentUICulture = CultureInfo.GetCultureInfo(userCultureSpecified);
                 }
                 catch(Exception)
                 {
